WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.550
- Hey, what's up, Khan Academy students?

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.420
It's Tony Hawk.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.150
I just want to wish you guys the best.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.330
I know it is the strangest of times to be

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.840
in school, feeling isolated.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.560
And just know we're
gonna get through this,

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.410
and it's gonna show your
determination, your perseverance,

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.900
making it through and
and doing well in school,

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.070
because it's hard.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.160
My daughter's in the same boat,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.800
and it's hard for her to stay
motivated, but you can do it.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.020
You just gotta dig deep.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.190
Believe in yourself.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.580
And hope you guys can make it a great year

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.030
in spite of everything the
world has thrown at you.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:31.863
All right?

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:34.000
And I'm pulling for you.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.240
I'll see you on the other side of this.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.190
Okay. Thanks, guys.

